<title>JAPAN: Japan Marine Tech - 1996 group results.</title>
<headline>Japan Marine Tech - 1996 group results.</headline>
<dateline>TOKYO 1997-02-27</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to December 31, 1996</p>
<p> (Group)	(in billions of yen unless specified)</p>
<p> Sales		  4.00		vs	    3.64</p>
<p> Operating	  514    million    vs	  392    million</p>
<p> Current	    536    million    vs	  395    million</p>
